            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:grammar-fill:1",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:grammar-fill:1",
            "text": "A newly opened mini theater “Hello, Xizang” in Beijing has brought/has been bringing the rich traditions of Xizang to the heart of China’s capital city since late February, 2025."
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:grammar-fill:2",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:grammar-fill:2",
            "text": "The theater has successfully made its first public show with an immersive (沉浸的) performance “Lhasa, Lhasa”, a showcase of Xizang intangible cultural heritage (非物质文化遗产), which will last for about three months. The play, keeping its audience on the edge of their seats, features a dynamic mix of traditional Xizang opera, folk music, and ceremonial tea-serving songs. The unique music of the highland and the bright colors of the dancers’ costumes make people seated at the theater feel as if they were bathed in the sunlight of Xizang."
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:grammar-fill:3",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:grammar-fill:3",
            "text": "The mini theater is part of an initiative to promote Xizang culture and introduce the essence of the city – its landscapes, traditions and people—to urban audience across China. “It is a novel approach to advertising diverse cultures”, said a spokesperson for the theater. “By combining traditional culture with creative expression, we have broken down geographical barriers and spread the highland culture to inner cities.”"
          },
          {
            "textId": "done-block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:grammar-fill:4",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-mock-liaoning-shenyang-2025-04-northeast-joint:grammar-fill:4",
            "text": "The theater has already established close partnerships with several cultural exchange organizations, aiming to expand its reach to the world. “Our mission is not just to further develop Xizang culture, but also to let the world have a better understanding of Xizang.”"
          }
        ],
